@@ -1,5 +1,12 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Availability endpoint (`GET /bookings/availability`) listing the free slots of a room.
+- Conflict detection now covers every overlap, not only the start of the new booking.
+- Booking rules (future start, 30 minutes to 8 hours, existing room and user) applied on
+  creation and on any change of room or schedule.
+
 ## 1.0.0
 
 - Rooms, users, bookings and amenities endpoints.
